  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "15700482",
      "title": "Using the Custom Store",
      "sourceHash": "6b5e3587cbf23ce66401f03d5b86423027fd3971d1ef93e4b43918b395ce6ec7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.37,
          "end": 5.16,
          "en": "So to use that custom store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.16,
          "end": 6.74,
          "en": "let's go to the index.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.74,
          "end": 8.51,
          "en": "and get rid of the ProductsProvider,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.51,
          "end": 10.95,
          "en": "which is our context API in action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.95,
          "end": 12.39,
          "en": "Can we get rid of that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.39,
          "end": 17.03,
          "en": "And instead import configureStore from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.85,
          "end": 25.5,
          "en": "hooks-store/products-store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.5,
          "end": 29.03,
          "en": "and call that here to step up our store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.03,
          "end": 30.91,
          "en": "Now, the cool thing is we we don't need to wrap this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.91,
          "end": 32.08,
          "en": "in a provider component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.08,
          "end": 33.52,
          "en": "or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.52,
          "end": 38.21,
          "en": "This will make sure that we initialize our store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.21,
          "end": 41.43,
          "en": "since we import initStore from the store file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.43,
          "end": 43.51,
          "en": "These things here will all be set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.51,
          "end": 46.2,
          "en": "and they will be initialized with the values we're passing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.2,
          "end": 48.11,
          "en": "in our products-store.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.11,
          "end": 49.44,
          "en": "If we had multiple stores,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.44,
          "end": 51.97,
          "en": "we would simply call ConfigureStore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.97,
          "end": 53.34,
          "en": "for these different stores.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.34,
          "end": 55.53,
          "en": "We would just have to give these functions different names.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.53,
          "end": 58.08,
          "en": "You can, for example, name this ConfigureProductsStore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.08,
          "end": 59.99,
          "en": "of course, because it's the default export.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.99,
          "end": 61.3,
          "en": "You can name this whatever you want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 61.3,
          "end": 64.21,
          "en": "and you would call all these configureStore functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 64.21,
          "end": 66.38,
          "en": "for all the different store parts you might have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.38,
          "end": 67.213,
          "en": "in your app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 67.213,
          "end": 69.78,
          "en": "And with that, the store is ready to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 69.78,
          "end": 72.03,
          "en": "Now, to use it, we can simply go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 72.03,
          "end": 73.63,
          "en": "to the place where we need it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 73.63,
          "end": 77.19,
          "en": "Like here, the Products.js container file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 77.19,
          "end": 79.924,
          "en": "Instead of importing our context there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 79.924,
          "end": 83.9,
          "en": "we can import useStore, so our custom hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 83.9,
          "end": 87.4,
          "en": "from hooks-store/store now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 87.4,
          "end": 90.004,
          "en": "so not from the productsStore but just store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 90.004,
          "end": 92.506,
          "en": "and useStore gives us access to the globalStore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 92.506,
          "end": 94.74000000000001,
          "en": "and the globalDispatch function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 94.74000000000001,
          "end": 97.413,
          "en": "So now here, we can useStore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.551,
          "end": 101.67,
          "en": "Don't need to pass anything there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 101.67,
          "end": 106.58,
          "en": "and what we get back is our state and a dispatch function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 106.58,
          "end": 108.833,
          "en": "That's what we get back from useStore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 110.4,
          "end": 111.74000000000001,
          "en": "Now, of course, here I'm not interested",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 111.74000000000001,
          "end": 113.09,
          "en": "in the dispatch function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.09,
          "end": 115.97,
          "en": "so I can simply just get my state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 115.97,
          "end": 118.15,
          "en": "by just accessing the first element returned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 118.15,
          "end": 120.22,
          "en": "by the custom store, by the custom hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 120.22,
          "end": 122.41,
          "en": "because the custom hook returns two things,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 122.41,
          "end": 123.82,
          "en": "globalState and dispatch.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 123.82,
          "end": 124.93,
          "en": "If I only need the State,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 124.93,
          "end": 126.45,
          "en": "you just extract the first element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 126.45,
          "end": 129.54,
          "en": "from the array with this syntax, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 129.54,
          "end": 131.18,
          "en": "So that's our state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 131.18,
          "end": 134.17,
          "en": "and therefore, here we can output state.products",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 134.17,
          "end": 137.14,
          "en": "because we know there will be a products key in our state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 137.14,
          "end": 138.61,
          "en": "because that's what we're setting up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 138.61,
          "end": 140.35,
          "en": "in the products-store.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 140.35,
          "end": 142.063,
          "en": "when we initialize our state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 142.063,
          "end": 146.42000000000002,
          "en": "then here the second argument we passed to initStore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 146.42000000000002,
          "end": 148.81,
          "en": "is our object where we add a products key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 148.81,
          "end": 152.22,
          "en": "that is what will be initialized,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 152.22,
          "end": 154.828,
          "en": "second argument, as our initialState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 154.828,
          "end": 156.28300000000002,
          "en": "what will be merged with the globalState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 156.28300000000002,
          "end": 158.93,
          "en": "and therefore the globalState will have a products key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 158.93,
          "end": 161.27,
          "en": "and that's what I'm accessing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 161.27,
          "end": 164.03,
          "en": "Now, to test this, let's go to ProductItem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 164.03,
          "end": 166.42000000000002,
          "en": "and get rid of our context thing there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 166.42000000000002,
          "end": 168.403,
          "en": "because that won't work right now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 169.32999999999998,
          "end": 172.803,
          "en": "Get rid of this and comment this out and save that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 174.62,
          "end": 175.939,
          "en": "And if you reload this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 175.939,
          "end": 178.91,
          "en": "you should still see all your products there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 178.91,
          "end": 181.108,
          "en": "Now let's make the favorite button work again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 181.108,
          "end": 183.42,
          "en": "And if it's in the ProductItem file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 183.42,
          "end": 185.328,
          "en": "instead of importing useContext,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 185.328,
          "end": 188.09,
          "en": "we can import useStore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 194.02,
          "end": 199.02,
          "en": "from the hooks-store folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 199.16,
          "end": 201.123,
          "en": "and there it is Store.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 202.15,
          "end": 204.498,
          "en": "And here we can useStore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 204.498,
          "end": 206.31,
          "en": "and now I'm only interested in the dispatch function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 206.31,
          "end": 210.97,
          "en": "which is our second argument we return in our store here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 210.97,
          "end": 211.93,
          "en": "We return this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 211.93,
          "end": 213.9,
          "en": "Dispatches the second argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 213.9,
          "end": 215.74,
          "en": "Or the second element I should say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 215.74,
          "end": 217.857,
          "en": "So I'm extracting that second element here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 217.857,
          "end": 221.03300000000002,
          "en": "That's the dispatch function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 221.99,
          "end": 224.91,
          "en": "So I store it in this dispatch constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 224.91,
          "end": 226.75,
          "en": "We can call dispatch here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 226.75,
          "end": 230.438,
          "en": "and now what I want to dispatch is an action identifier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 230.438,
          "end": 234.22,
          "en": "which is TOGGLE_FAV",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 234.22,
          "end": 236.78,
          "en": "and we'll then look for such an identifier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 236.78,
          "end": 238.233,
          "en": "in our actins map",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 238.233,
          "end": 242.08,
          "en": "which I set up in products-store there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 242.08,
          "end": 245.13,
          "en": "This is the actions map which I used to initialize my store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 245.13,
          "end": 247.57,
          "en": "It'll be merged into the global actions map",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 247.57,
          "end": 250.07,
          "en": "and there I have TOGGLE_FAV as an identifier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 250.07,
          "end": 252.61,
          "en": "and this needs a payload of productId",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 252.61,
          "end": 253.49,
          "en": "which is good to know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 253.49,
          "end": 255.98,
          "en": "because that's the second argument we can forward here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 255.98,
          "end": 259.02,
          "en": "Props.id and that should be all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 259.02,
          "end": 262.53,
          "en": "With that change, now we can mark things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 262.53,
          "end": 264.05,
          "en": "as a favorite again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 264.05,
          "end": 266.38,
          "en": "Now let's make sure the Favorites page works again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 266.38,
          "end": 269,
          "en": "because right now it's not working, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 269,
          "end": 270.08,
          "en": "even though I have favorites",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 270.08,
          "end": 273.07,
          "en": "because it still tries to get them from the context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 273.07,
          "end": 275.23,
          "en": "So in the Favorites.js file here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 275.23,
          "end": 277.047,
          "en": "let's not import the context anymore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 277.047,
          "end": 282.047,
          "en": "but again import useStore from the hooks-store folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 284.62,
          "end": 286.86,
          "en": "and there the store.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 286.86,
          "end": 291.06,
          "en": "and then here, we got our state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 291.06,
          "end": 294.65,
          "en": "which is useStore and there the first element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 294.65,
          "end": 298.24,
          "en": "And I'm interested in my favoriteProducts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 298.24,
          "end": 301.493,
          "en": "which I get by accessing state.products, oops.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 302.79,
          "end": 305.66,
          "en": "State.products.filter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 305.66,
          "end": 307.44,
          "en": "and then I search for all products",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 307.44,
          "end": 312.003,
          "en": "which are a favorite like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 313.07,
          "end": 314.9,
          "en": "So yeah, by the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 314.9,
          "end": 317.22,
          "en": "make sure you of course, execute your custom hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 317.22,
          "end": 319.49,
          "en": "that's important, add parentheses here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 319.49,
          "end": 320.93,
          "en": "Save this and give it a try.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 320.93,
          "end": 322.75,
          "en": "Got no products yet after the reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 322.75,
          "end": 326.36,
          "en": "but now let's add two and we see them here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 326.36,
          "end": 328.69,
          "en": "So this is now working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 328.69,
          "end": 330.33,
          "en": "And I'm totally aware",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 330.33,
          "end": 334.32,
          "en": "that this kind of hard to wrap your head around at first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 334.32,
          "end": 337.68,
          "en": "So let me sum this up by briefly going through that again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 337.68,
          "end": 338.683,
          "en": "in the next lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}